    },
    "body": "Draft until reindex-chainstate performance is measured.\n\n----\n\n**Problem:** Block preparation inserts an unused final transaction ID, repeatedly constructs salted transaction-ID sets, and allocates a worker-task vector. Small input queues also submit more tasks than can do useful work.\n\n**Fix:** Insert each transaction ID before scanning the following transaction's inputs. Reuse the set's buckets and hash salt and the worker-task vector across blocks. Limit submitted tasks to the smaller of the worker and queued-input counts.",
